  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategisk programmering af danske migrationsindsatser langs migrationsruterne</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory analysis for the Danish regional migration programme along the Mediterranean migratory routes. 

The future migration programme will target the needs of people on the move along these routes, and the purpose of the preparatory analysis is to ensure that the programme is built on solid knowledge, lessons learned, as well as objective information and data, including on needs and vulnerabilities of people on the move.</narrative>
  </description>
